<title>USA: Streamlogic says payment due Sept. 15.</title>
<headline>Streamlogic says payment due Sept. 15.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp said Wednesday its principal and interest payment on its six percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2012 is set for Sept. 15, not June 15 as it had announced Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said it cannot make any assurances that it will be able to make the appropriate payment on Sept. 15.</p>
<p>In light of correcting its original announcement, the company said it is not in technical payment default under the debentures.</p>
